OL,3,GNEWSARoads and car parks to shut for
OL,4,Acharter fair
OL,5,
OL,6,FTown centre roads and car parks are set
OL,7,Fto close with the arrival of Ilkeston
OL,8,FCharter Fair.
OL,10,FThe event will return to the town for
OL,11,Fthe 774th time when it opens at 18:00
OL,12,FBST on Wednesday.
OL,14,FTo make space for the thrill rides,
OL,15,Fstalls and sideshows, Market Place and
OL,16,Fnearby streets including parts of Bath
OL,17,FStreet and South Street will be shut to
OL,18,Ftraffic from Tuesday until 26 October,
OL,19,FErewash Borough Council said.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
